<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan's Mitac says 96 sales up 1.09 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan's Mitac says 96 sales up 1.09 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mitac International Corp, one of Taiwan's leading computer makers, said on Thursday that its 1996 sales revenues were T$12.497 billion, up 1.09 percent from T$12.362 billion in the previous year.</p>
<p>In December, Mitac's sales were T$965.89 million, falling 30.42 percent from December 1995.</p>
<p>It did not give profit figures.</p>
<p>Mitac has said it was optimistic about its 1997 outlooks.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
